This is a modified version of the original ScriptTask plugin. The changes include
a redesigned interface for MeshCentral's Modern UI, the ScriptTask management page,
a new scheduling engine, batches, plugin permissions, secret variables and new
settings. Files changed from the original carry a "Modified by" notice in their
header; changelog.md lists the changes in detail.

Bundled third-party software keeps its own licence, listed in includes/vendor/LICENSE-*:
Preact and htm (MIT), CodeMirror 6 and its language and theme packages (MIT),
and Bootstrap Icons (MIT).
